{{also|Maandag}}
==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|dum|nl}} {{term|manendach|lang=dum}}, {{term|maendach|lang=dum}}, from {{etyl|odt|nl}} *''mānendag'', from late {{etyl|gem-pro|nl}} {{recons|mēniniz dagaz||day of the moon|lang=gem-pro}}. Compare West Frisian {{term|moandei|lang=fy}}, German {{term|Montag|lang=de}}, English {{term|Monday|lang=en}}, Danish {{term|mandag|lang=da}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈmaːn.dɑx/|lang=nl}}
* {{audio|Nl-maandag.ogg|audio}}

===Noun===
{{nl-noun|m|maandagen|maandagje}}

# [[Monday]]

